{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32602","headline":"怀汶阳兄弟 · 刘沧","name":"怀汶阳兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回看云岭思茫茫，几处关河隔汶阳。\n书信经年乡国远，弟兄无力海田荒。\n天高霜月砧声苦，风满寒林木叶黄。\n终日路岐归未得，秋来空羡鴈成行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}